        <p>Both paths can include cameras and the protection devices your property needs. Compatible door locks, garage controls, and Nest thermostats can also be integrated for phone control.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-security-options">
        <a id="local-security" href="sms:{{ site.phone_tel }}?body=I%27m%20interested%20in%20a%20local%20security%20system%20with%20cameras.%20My%20city%20is%3A%20">
