          <p>Plan cameras and protection devices around the property and daily routine.</p>
          <small>Start a text →</small>
        </a>
        <a class="contact-security-monitored" id="adt-security" href="sms:{{ site.phone_tel }}?body=I%27m%20interested%20in%20an%20ADT-monitored%20security%20system%20with%20cameras%20included%20for%20%2469.99%2Fmo%20or%20less.%20My%20city%20is%3A%20">
